      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_safely_deploying_capable_models_mean",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
      "text": "Safely deploying capable models means catching confident falsehoods, and probes that read a model's own truth representation could help, but only if we understand them.",
