      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
      "text": "CCS is described by two statistics along the probe direction: sigma-d-squared, how far a statement and its negation are pushed apart, and sigma-m-squared, how far their midpoint sits from origin.",
